---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";

// Transcribed from the mockup (privacy.html). The "[Gym: …]" placeholder
// section on how data is stored and protected is left out until the owner
// supplies real wording; sections renumbered.
---

<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy — Zen Martial Arts & Fitness"
  description="Privacy policy for Zen Martial Arts & Fitness, Chilliwack, BC."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lede="Last updated: September 19, 2026. This explains what information Zen Martial Arts & Fitness collects through this website and how it's used."
>
  <p class="legal-callout">
    <strong>Before you publish this:</strong> this is a starting template, not legal
    advice. It's written to align with Canada's federal private-sector privacy law
    (PIPEDA), which generally applies to a small BC business like this one, but have
    it reviewed before publishing — especially the sections on kids' information and
    any booking or payment processor you connect.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    When you book a free trial or contact us through this website, we collect
    the information you provide directly: name, email address, phone number, and
    which class you're interested in. If you sign up for membership in person,
    we also collect the information on your membership and waiver paperwork.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Information about children</h2>
  <p>
    For kids' programs, information about a minor is provided and controlled by
    their parent or guardian. We only use it to manage class registration,
    safety, and communication with the parent or guardian — never for marketing
    directed at the child.
  </p>

  <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
  <p>
    We use your information to respond to trial requests, manage your
    membership, communicate about classes and schedule changes, and process
    payments. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Cookies and embedded content</h2>
  <p>
    This site embeds a map from Google Maps, which may set cookies or collect
    technical data (like your IP address) under Google's own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to see, correct, or request deletion of the personal information
    we hold about you by contacting us using the details below.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy or your information: <a
      href="mailto:info@zenmartialarts.ca">info@zenmartialarts.ca</a
    > or <a href="tel:+17788356590">778-835-6590</a>, 48640 Yale Rd, Chilliwack,
    BC V4Z 0B1.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
